{"id":"wb-6-684","name":"韩文公祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"韩文公祠","text":"韩文公祠位于中国广东省潮州市湘桥区韩江东岸笔架山中峰西麓中轴线上，现址始建于南宋淳熙十六年（公元1189年），之后元、明、清各代均有续修，现主体基本为明、清建筑。是中国大陆现存的保存最完整历史最久远的纪念唐代韩愈的专祠。“韩祠橡木”是潮州八景之一。2006年5月25日，中国国务院列入第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9F%A9%E6%96%87%E5%85%AC%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":94091908,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94091908","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d87c392fb01bc3004d0bf3a0.jpg","title":"Chaozhou_Hanwengong_Ci_2013.10.27_09-04-35.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chaozhou_Hanwengong_Ci_2013.10.27_09-04-35.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6e/Chaozhou_Hanwengong_Ci_2013.10.27_09-04-35.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"潮州韩文公祠","width":320,"height":213}}